youtube/youtube.response.js is an unmodified copy of Script/Youtube/youtube.response.js
from https://github.com/Maasea/sgmodule (Apache License 2.0, see LICENSE in this folder).
The pinned upstream commit and file hash are recorded in state.json.

youtube/YouTube-Enhance.sgmodule is the user's copy of Maasea's "Youtube (Music) Enhance"
module (older layout, local-only). The only change is script-path, which points to the copy
in this repository so that upstream changes are adopted only after review. The upstream
request script (youtube.request.js), which relays playback requests to a third-party
server, is intentionally not used.

Not an official YouTube, Google, Shadowrocket or Maasea release.
